compact</link><description>首尔的一所学校为父母逃离朝鲜的学生提供服务。邻居们希望它消失，学生们表示这只是他们在南方面临的偏见的一个例子。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:51:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/world/asia/the-threat-to-a-sanctuary-for-children-of-north-korean-defectors.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>招募人员引诱巴西人参加俄罗斯战争，然后偷走了他们的钱</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/world/americas/brazil-recruiting-russia-army.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>数十名巴西人几乎没有受过训练就被派往前线，他们说，他们所承诺的高薪最终证明是虚幻的。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:36:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/world/americas/brazil-recruiting-russia-army.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>日本排球运动员打破禁忌</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/world/asia/a-japanese-volleyball-player-breaks-a-taboo.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>26 岁的高桥睿 (Rui Takahashi) 是日本仅有的少数公开同性恋身份的职业运动员之一，引起了轰动。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:21:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/world/asia/a-japanese-volleyball-player-breaks-a-taboo.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>一座城市担心其码头在部分塌陷入海后失去</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/pacifica-pier-collapse-el-nino-king-tides.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>加利福尼亚州帕西菲卡著名的码头早已摇摇欲坠。本周，它的一部分屈服于猛烈的海浪并落入海中。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:06:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/pacifica-pier-collapse-el-nino-king-tides.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>有证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>爱荷华州一家工厂的不稳定爆炸物清除工作一年多前就开始了，但当时尚未完成，为周三有争议的爆炸埋下了伏笔。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:51:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>怀孕囚犯乘坐新墨西哥州监狱运输车越狱</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/pregnant-inmate-escapes-new-mexico.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>当局称，26 岁的囚犯丽贝卡·泰勒 (Rebecca Taylor) 在做完产前预约返回监狱时，在 Whataburger 停车场控制了这辆 SUV。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:36:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/pregnant-inmate-escapes-new-mexico.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>对于失败的威斯康星州州长候选人来说，感恩节又回到了菜单上</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/thanksgiving-wisconsin-governor-francesca-hong.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>弗朗西斯卡·洪(Francesca Hong)在竞选民主党提名期间因在社交媒体上发帖谴责这个节日而受到热议，现在她感到后悔了，并一笑置之。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:21:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/thanksgiving-wisconsin-governor-francesca-hong.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>食品券计划的削减威胁到免费校餐</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/snap-food-stamps-school-meals.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>特朗普政府对补充营养援助计划的削减和拟议的监管改革将对学校午餐和早餐产生影响。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:06:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/snap-food-stamps-school-meals.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>两党监管人工智能的愿望在国会面临障碍</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>两党成员均表示，他们希望解决人工智能政策问题，但立法步伐缓慢和地盘之争可能会成为障碍。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:51:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item